              "# China's FX reserves fall in 2018 as slowing economy, trade war weigh\nBy Stella Qiu and Kevin Yao\n\nJanuary 7, 2019 9:11 AM UTC Updated ago\n\n- Summary\n\n- Reserves fall $67.24 bln in 2018, vs gain of $129.4 bln in\n\n2017\n\n* Reserves rise $11 bln in Dec to $3.073 trln, slightly top f'cast",
